/-
# Obend.Hardware.Gpu.Rdna2.Residuals — the residuals the certificates need, each proved

Generated by `obend-rdna2 reslib` over every dumped graph (adjoint-mul-add, adjoint-square-bilinear, allops, diamond, glmul-256, glmul-4, mac-reverse-1000, muxchain, ntt-1024, ntt-16, ntt-4, ntt-64, ntt-65536, optic-bilinear, optic-linearmac, optic-mul, tree512); do not edit:
`hardware/gpu/isa_check.sh` regenerates it and compares bytes. Each residual is the pair of terms the
check leaves for a stored dword after cutting (`Equiv`), over leaf variables, built here by `node` exactly
as the check builds it, so that `certify`'s membership test finds it. Each is proved for every memory:
by `bv_decide`, by `grind` where it multiplies, or, where it is a 64-bit ring identity written in limbs,
by `W.holds_hi` and `grind` on the 64-bit words (`Lift`).
-/
